            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "response_to_critic": "Accepted ValidatorAgent's recommendation to reduce max_distance from 16 to 10. This adds robustness by ensuring the player must actually approach the shelter rather than potentially triggering from spawn by simply facing the right direction. Since the player spawns ~7.3 blocks from the cauldron, a max_distance of 10 still allows detection from the shelter entrance (which is at x=4, about 2 blocks closer than the cauldron itself) while preventing false positives from spawn. The facing_tolerance of 60 degrees remains appropriate for a find task.",
